  "html": "<h1>РАЗДАЧА ЗП<small>смена</small></h1><div class=\"mut\" id=\"cloud\" style=\"margin:-8px 10px 6px\"></div><div class=\"card\"><label>Смена<select id=\"vsel\" style=\"width:100%;margin-top:4px\"><option value=\"c1793610000000\" selected=\"\">Текущая: 02.11.2026 · 0 чел.</option></select></label></div><div class=\"lbl\">БАНК</div><div class=\"card\"><div class=\"g\"><label>Банк, ₽ (кг × 500, салат × 400)<input id=\"bank\" type=\"text\" readonly=\"\" value=\"0\"></label><label>К выдаче всего, ₽<input type=\"text\" readonly=\"\" value=\"0\"></label></div></div><div class=\"lbl\">СОТРУДНИКИ</div><div class=\"card pr\"><span class=\"n\">Саня</span><input data-s=\"0\" type=\"text\" inputmode=\"decimal\" placeholder=\"сал\" value=\"\" style=\"width:54px\"><input data-a=\"0\" type=\"text\" inputmode=\"numeric\" placeholder=\"сумма\" value=\"\" style=\"width:112px\"><span class=\"rub\">₽</span></div><div class=\"card pr\"><span class=\"n\">Даня</span><input data-s=\"1\" type=\"text\" inputmode=\"decimal\" placeholder=\"сал\" value=\"\" style=\"width:54px\"><input data-a=\"1\" type=\"text\" inputmode=\"numeric\" placeholder=\"сумма\" value=\"\" style=\"width:112px\"><span class=\"rub\">₽</span></div><div class=\"card pr\"><span class=\"n\">Ваня</span><input data-s=\"2\" type=\"text\" inputmode=\"decimal\" placeholder=\"сал\" value=\"\" style=\"width:54px\"><input data-a=\"2\" type=\"text\" inputmode=\"numeric\" placeholder=\"сумма\" value=\"\" style=\"width:112px\"><span class=\"rub\">₽</span></div><div class=\"card pr\"><span class=\"n\">Эля</span><input data-s=\"3\" type=\"text\" inputmode=\"decimal\" placeholder=\"сал\" value=\"\" style=\"width:54px\"><input data-a=\"3\" type=\"text\" inputmode=\"numeric\" placeholder=\"сумма\" value=\"\" style=\"width:112px\"><span class=\"rub\">₽</span></div><div class=\"card pr\"><span class=\"n\">Эльнур</span><input data-s=\"4\" type=\"text\" inputmode=\"decimal\" placeholder=\"сал\" value=\"\" style=\"width:54px\"><input data-a=\"4\" type=\"text\" inputmode=\"numeric\" placeholder=\"сумма\" value=\"\" style=\"width:112px\"><span class=\"rub\">₽</span></div><div class=\"card pr\"><span class=\"n\">Витя</span><input data-s=\"5\" type=\"text\" inputmode=\"decimal\" placeholder=\"сал\" value=\"\" style=\"width:54px\"><input data-a=\"5\" type=\"text\" inputmode=\"numeric\" placeholder=\"сумма\" value=\"\" style=\"width:112px\"><span class=\"rub\">₽</span></div><div class=\"card pr\"><span class=\"n\">Егор</span><input data-s=\"6\" type=\"text\" inputmode=\"decimal\" placeholder=\"сал\" value=\"\" style=\"width:54px\"><input data-a=\"6\" type=\"text\" inputmode=\"numeric\" placeholder=\"сумма\" value=\"\" style=\"width:112px\"><span class=\"rub\">₽</span></div><div class=\"card pr\"><span class=\"n\">Костя</span><input data-s=\"7\" type=\"text\" inputmode=\"decimal\" placeholder=\"сал\" value=\"\" style=\"width:54px\"><input data-a=\"7\" type=\"text\" inputmode=\"numeric\" placeholder=\"сумма\" value=\"\" style=\"width:112px\"><span class=\"rub\">₽</span></div><div class=\"card pr\"><span class=\"n\">Аня</span><input data-s=\"8\" type=\"text\" inputmode=\"decimal\" placeholder=\"сал\" value=\"\" style=\"width:54px\"><input data-a=\"8\" type=\"text\" inputmode=\"numeric\" placeholder=\"сумма\" value=\"\" style=\"width:112px\"><span class=\"rub\">₽</span></div><div class=\"card pr\"><span class=\"n\">Тёма</span><input data-s=\"9\" type=\"text\" inputmode=\"decimal\" placeholder=\"сал\" value=\"\" style=\"width:54px\"><input data-a=\"9\" type=\"text\" inputmode=\"numeric\" placeholder=\"сумма\" value=\"\" style=\"width:112px\"><span class=\"rub\">₽</span></div><div class=\"card pr\"><span class=\"n\">Женя</span><input data-s=\"10\" type=\"text\" inputmode=\"decimal\" placeholder=\"сал\" value=\"\" style=\"width:54px\"><input data-a=\"10\" type=\"text\" inputmode=\"numeric\" placeholder=\"сумма\" value=\"\" style=\"width:112px\"><span class=\"rub\">₽</span></div><div class=\"card pr\"><span class=\"n\">Гор</span><input data-s=\"11\" type=\"text\" inputmode=\"decimal\" placeholder=\"сал\" value=\"\" style=\"width:54px\"><input data-a=\"11\" type=\"text\" inputmode=\"numeric\" placeholder=\"сумма\" value=\"\" style=\"width:112px\"><span class=\"rub\">₽</span></div><div style=\"margin:16px 4px\"><button class=\"pill g2\" id=\"clr\">Очистить суммы, банк, катера и этапы</button></div><p class=\"mut\" style=\"margin:0 8px\">Серая сумма считается сама: кг по этапам × ставка, вниз до 100. Впишите свою, чтобы заменить. Ставки задаются на вкладке «Смена». Пустая сумма означает, что человека в этой смене нет.</p><details id=\"tbo\"><summary class=\"lbl\">ТАБЕЛЬ КАТЕРОВ</summary><div class=\"card\"><p class=\"mut\" style=\"margin:0\">Для этой смены нет этапов с отмеченными людьми, поэтому табель недоступен.</p></div></details><nav><div class=\"ng\" style=\"grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr)\"><button data-t=\"shift\" class=\"\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><rect x=\"5\" y=\"4\" width=\"14\" height=\"17\" rx=\"2.5\"></rect><path d=\"M9 4.5h6M9 12l2 2 4-4M9 17h6\"></path></svg>Смена</button><button data-t=\"people\" class=\"on\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"8\" r=\"3.2\"></circle><path d=\"M3 20c0-3.5 2.7-6 6-6s6 2.5 6 6\"></path><circle cx=\"17\" cy=\"9\" r=\"2.5\"></circle><path d=\"M17 14c2.6 0 4.5 2 4.5 5\"></path></svg>Люди</button><button data-t=\"sum\" class=\"\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M5 4h14M5 10h14M5 16h9\"></path><path d=\"M15 19.5l2.2 2L21 17.5\"></path></svg>Итог</button></div><div class=\"ng\" style=\"grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)\"><button data-t=\"tab\" class=\"\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><rect x=\"3.5\" y=\"3.5\" width=\"7\" height=\"7\" rx=\"2\"></rect><rect x=\"13.5\" y=\"3.5\" width=\"7\" height=\"7\" rx=\"2\"></rect><rect x=\"3.5\" y=\"13.5\" width=\"7\" height=\"7\" rx=\"2\"></rect><rect x=\"13.5\" y=\"13.5\" width=\"7\" height=\"7\" rx=\"2\"></rect></svg>Выплаты</button><button data-t=\"log\" class=\"\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><rect x=\"4.5\" y=\"3.5\" width=\"15\" height=\"17\" rx=\"2.5\"></rect><path d=\"M8 8h8M8 12h8M8 16h5\"></path></svg>Журнал</button></div></nav>",
