  "html": "<h1>РАЗДАЧА ЗП<small>смена</small></h1><div class=\"mut\" id=\"cloud\" style=\"margin:-8px 10px 6px\"></div><div class=\"card\"><label>Дата смены<input id=\"sdate\" type=\"date\" value=\"2026-11-02\"></label></div><div class=\"lbl\">КАТЕРА</div><div class=\"card pr\"><input data-bb=\"0\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"№\" value=\"\" style=\"width:56px;text-align:center\"><input data-bc=\"0\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"капитан\" value=\"\" style=\"flex:1;width:auto;min-width:0;text-align:left;font-family:inherit\"><input data-bk=\"0\" type=\"text\" inputmode=\"decimal\" placeholder=\"кг\" value=\"\" style=\"width:76px\"><input data-bm=\"0\" type=\"text\" inputmode=\"decimal\" placeholder=\"кам\" value=\"\" style=\"width:60px\"><button class=\"x\" data-xb=\"0\">×</button></div><div class=\"card pr\"><input data-bb=\"1\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"№\" value=\"\" style=\"width:56px;text-align:center\"><input data-bc=\"1\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"капитан\" value=\"\" style=\"flex:1;width:auto;min-width:0;text-align:left;font-family:inherit\"><input data-bk=\"1\" type=\"text\" inputmode=\"decimal\" placeholder=\"кг\" value=\"\" style=\"width:76px\"><input data-bm=\"1\" type=\"text\" inputmode=\"decimal\" placeholder=\"кам\" value=\"\" style=\"width:60px\"><button class=\"x\" data-xb=\"1\">×</button></div><div class=\"card pr\"><input data-bb=\"2\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"№\" value=\"\" style=\"width:56px;text-align:center\"><input data-bc=\"2\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"капитан\" value=\"\" style=\"flex:1;width:auto;min-width:0;text-align:left;font-family:inherit\"><input data-bk=\"2\" type=\"text\" inputmode=\"decimal\" placeholder=\"кг\" value=\"\" style=\"width:76px\"><input data-bm=\"2\" type=\"text\" inputmode=\"decimal\" placeholder=\"кам\" value=\"\" style=\"width:60px\"><button class=\"x\" data-xb=\"2\">×</button></div><div class=\"card pr\"><input data-bb=\"3\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"№\" value=\"\" style=\"width:56px;text-align:center\"><input data-bc=\"3\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"капитан\" value=\"\" style=\"flex:1;width:auto;min-width:0;text-align:left;font-family:inherit\"><input data-bk=\"3\" type=\"text\" inputmode=\"decimal\" placeholder=\"кг\" value=\"\" style=\"width:76px\"><input data-bm=\"3\" type=\"text\" inputmode=\"decimal\" placeholder=\"кам\" value=\"\" style=\"width:60px\"><button class=\"x\" data-xb=\"3\">×</button></div><div style=\"margin:8px 4px\"><button class=\"pill g2\" id=\"addb\">+ Катер</button> <span class=\"mut\" id=\"tkg\">Всего: 0 кг · банк 0 ₽</span></div><div class=\"lbl\">ЭТАПЫ И ЛЮДИ</div><p class=\"mut\" style=\"margin:0 10px 6px\">Новый этап: когда состав поменялся. Нажмите на имя, чтобы отметить, кто был на этапе.</p><div style=\"margin:8px 4px\"><button class=\"pill\" id=\"adds\">+ Этап</button> <button class=\"pill g2\" id=\"addbs\">+ След. катер</button></div><div class=\"mut\" id=\"tsk\" style=\"margin:0 10px\">Всего по этапам: 0 кг</div><p class=\"w\" id=\"warnk\" style=\"margin:4px 10px 0\"></p><details id=\"ppl\"><summary class=\"lbl\">ЛЮДИ · СТАВКА · КГ</summary><div class=\"card\"><div class=\"r2\"><b>Саня</b><span><select data-rt=\"0\"><option selected=\"\">500</option><option>480</option><option>450</option></select> <span class=\"mut\" id=\"pk0\">0 кг</span><button class=\"x\" data-xp=\"0\" style=\"margin-left:8px\">×</button></span></div><div class=\"r2\"><b>Даня</b><span><select data-rt=\"1\"><option selected=\"\">500</option><option>480</option><option>450</option></select> <span class=\"mut\" id=\"pk1\">0 кг</span><button class=\"x\" data-xp=\"1\" style=\"margin-left:8px\">×</button></span></div><div class=\"r2\"><b>Ваня</b><span><select data-rt=\"2\"><option>500</option><option selected=\"\">480</option><option>450</option></select> <span class=\"mut\" id=\"pk2\">0 кг</span><button class=\"x\" data-xp=\"2\" style=\"margin-left:8px\">×</button></span></div><div class=\"r2\"><b>Эля</b><span><select data-rt=\"3\"><option>500</option><option selected=\"\">480</option><option>450</option></select> <span class=\"mut\" id=\"pk3\">0 кг</span><button class=\"x\" data-xp=\"3\" style=\"margin-left:8px\">×</button></span></div><div class=\"r2\"><b>Эльнур</b><span><select data-rt=\"4\"><option>500</option><option selected=\"\">480</option><option>450</option></select> <span class=\"mut\" id=\"pk4\">0 кг</span><button class=\"x\" data-xp=\"4\" style=\"margin-left:8px\">×</button></span></div><div class=\"r2\"><b>Витя</b><span><select data-rt=\"5\"><option>500</option><option selected=\"\">480</option><option>450</option></select> <span class=\"mut\" id=\"pk5\">0 кг</span><button class=\"x\" data-xp=\"5\" style=\"margin-left:8px\">×</button></span></div><div class=\"r2\"><b>Егор</b><span><select data-rt=\"6\"><option>500</option><option selected=\"\">480</option><option>450</option></select> <span class=\"mut\" id=\"pk6\">0 кг</span><button class=\"x\" data-xp=\"6\" style=\"margin-left:8px\">×</button></span></div><div class=\"r2\"><b>Костя</b><span><select data-rt=\"7\"><option>500</option><option selected=\"\">480</option><option>450</option></select> <span class=\"mut\" id=\"pk7\">0 кг</span><button class=\"x\" data-xp=\"7\" style=\"margin-left:8px\">×</button></span></div><div class=\"r2\"><b>Аня</b><span><select data-rt=\"8\"><option>500</option><option>480</option><option selected=\"\">450</option></select> <span class=\"mut\" id=\"pk8\">0 кг</span><button class=\"x\" data-xp=\"8\" style=\"margin-left:8px\">×</button></span></div><div class=\"r2\"><b>Тёма</b><span><select data-rt=\"9\"><option>500</option><option selected=\"\">480</option><option>450</option></select> <span class=\"mut\" id=\"pk9\">0 кг</span><button class=\"x\" data-xp=\"9\" style=\"margin-left:8px\">×</button></span></div><div class=\"r2\"><b>Женя</b><span><select data-rt=\"10\"><option>500</option><option selected=\"\">480</option><option>450</option></select> <span class=\"mut\" id=\"pk10\">0 кг</span><button class=\"x\" data-xp=\"10\" style=\"margin-left:8px\">×</button></span></div><div class=\"r2\"><b>Гор</b><span><select data-rt=\"11\"><option>500</option><option selected=\"\">480</option><option>450</option></select> <span class=\"mut\" id=\"pk11\">0 кг</span><button class=\"x\" data-xp=\"11\" style=\"margin-left:8px\">×</button></span></div><p class=\"mut\" style=\"margin:8px 0 0\">500: бригадир и бухгалтер, 480: рабочие, 450: помощники (выходят помочь).</p><div class=\"pr\" style=\"padding:12px 0 0\"><input id=\"newn\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Новое имя\" style=\"flex:1;width:auto;min-width:0;text-align:left;font-family:inherit\"><button class=\"pill\" id=\"add\" style=\"flex:none\">+ Добавить</button></div></div></details><nav><div class=\"ng\" style=\"grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr)\"><button data-t=\"shift\" class=\"on\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><rect x=\"5\" y=\"4\" width=\"14\" height=\"17\" rx=\"2.5\"></rect><path d=\"M9 4.5h6M9 12l2 2 4-4M9 17h6\"></path></svg>Смена</button><button data-t=\"people\" class=\"\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"8\" r=\"3.2\"></circle><path d=\"M3 20c0-3.5 2.7-6 6-6s6 2.5 6 6\"></path><circle cx=\"17\" cy=\"9\" r=\"2.5\"></circle><path d=\"M17 14c2.6 0 4.5 2 4.5 5\"></path></svg>Люди</button><button data-t=\"sum\" class=\"\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M5 4h14M5 10h14M5 16h9\"></path><path d=\"M15 19.5l2.2 2L21 17.5\"></path></svg>Итог</button></div><div class=\"ng\" style=\"grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)\"><button data-t=\"tab\" class=\"\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><rect x=\"3.5\" y=\"3.5\" width=\"7\" height=\"7\" rx=\"2\"></rect><rect x=\"13.5\" y=\"3.5\" width=\"7\" height=\"7\" rx=\"2\"></rect><rect x=\"3.5\" y=\"13.5\" width=\"7\" height=\"7\" rx=\"2\"></rect><rect x=\"13.5\" y=\"13.5\" width=\"7\" height=\"7\" rx=\"2\"></rect></svg>Выплаты</button><button data-t=\"log\" class=\"\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><rect x=\"4.5\" y=\"3.5\" width=\"15\" height=\"17\" rx=\"2.5\"></rect><path d=\"M8 8h8M8 12h8M8 16h5\"></path></svg>Журнал</button></div></nav>",
