  "html": "<h1>РАЗДАЧА ЗП<small>смена</small></h1><div class=\"mut\" id=\"cloud\" style=\"margin:-8px 10px 6px\"></div><div class=\"card\"><button class=\"pill g2\" id=\"pull\" style=\"margin-bottom:10px\">Обновить из таблицы</button></div><div class=\"card\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px\">✓ Все операции записаны в таблицу.</p></div><div class=\"card\"><div class=\"g\" style=\"grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,1fr)\"><label>Дата смены<select data-jf=\"sd\" style=\"width:100%;margin-top:4px\"><option value=\"\">Все</option></select></label><label>Сотрудник<select data-jf=\"n\" style=\"width:100%;margin-top:4px\"><option value=\"\">Все</option></select></label></div></div><div class=\"lbl\">ЖУРНАЛ ВЫПЛАТ · 0</div><div class=\"card jc\"><p class=\"mut\" style=\"margin:0\">Записей нет.</p></div><nav><div class=\"ng\" style=\"grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr)\"><button data-t=\"shift\" class=\"\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><rect x=\"5\" y=\"4\" width=\"14\" height=\"17\" rx=\"2.5\"></rect><path d=\"M9 4.5h6M9 12l2 2 4-4M9 17h6\"></path></svg>Смена</button><button data-t=\"people\" class=\"\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"8\" r=\"3.2\"></circle><path d=\"M3 20c0-3.5 2.7-6 6-6s6 2.5 6 6\"></path><circle cx=\"17\" cy=\"9\" r=\"2.5\"></circle><path d=\"M17 14c2.6 0 4.5 2 4.5 5\"></path></svg>Люди</button><button data-t=\"sum\" class=\"\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M5 4h14M5 10h14M5 16h9\"></path><path d=\"M15 19.5l2.2 2L21 17.5\"></path></svg>Итог</button></div><div class=\"ng\" style=\"grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)\"><button data-t=\"tab\" class=\"\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><rect x=\"3.5\" y=\"3.5\" width=\"7\" height=\"7\" rx=\"2\"></rect><rect x=\"13.5\" y=\"3.5\" width=\"7\" height=\"7\" rx=\"2\"></rect><rect x=\"3.5\" y=\"13.5\" width=\"7\" height=\"7\" rx=\"2\"></rect><rect x=\"13.5\" y=\"13.5\" width=\"7\" height=\"7\" rx=\"2\"></rect></svg>Выплаты</button><button data-t=\"log\" class=\"on\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><rect x=\"4.5\" y=\"3.5\" width=\"15\" height=\"17\" rx=\"2.5\"></rect><path d=\"M8 8h8M8 12h8M8 16h5\"></path></svg>Журнал</button></div></nav>",
